<title>ITALY: Milan bourse trading delayed by technical problem.</title>
<headline>Milan bourse trading delayed by technical problem.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares on the Milan stock market has been delayed on Monday morning due to a technical problem, the stock market council said.</p>
<p>Futures trade is not affected. A council spokesman said it would give further details at about 0730 GMT.</p>
